<title>MEXICO: Televisa receives $190 mln in Univision cash.</title>
<headline>Televisa receives $190 mln in Univision cash.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Media giant Grupo Televisa said on Tuesday it has received $190 million in cash from the repayment of receivables and indebtedness after an IPO and reorganization of Univision Communications.</p>
<p>It said it retains stock and warrants representing approximately a 19.8 percent fully diluted ownership stake in Univision, the top Spanish-language broadcaster in the United States. Its equity stake is valued at about $385 million, Televisa said.</p>
</text>
